{"title":"2005 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Chris and Pat are playing catch. Standing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/f/73fc5595f2c0be4a04869697724a604fae646c46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 m$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"24\" height=\"12\" /> apart, Pat first throws the ball to Chris and then Chris throws the ball back to Pat. Next, standing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/9/09930426d38eccb974422733e80ed818dcb14f2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 m$\" width=\"24\" height=\"12\" /> apart, Pat throws to Chris and Chris throws back to Pat. After each pair of throws, Chris moves <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/f/73fc5595f2c0be4a04869697724a604fae646c46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 m$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"24\" height=\"12\" /> farther away from Pat.\nThey stop playing when one of them misses the ball. If the game ends when the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/986c85c3c8fde5350e3ca94a6a768c70368bc42a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$29th$\" width=\"34\" height=\"12\" /> throw is missed, how far apart are they standing and who misses catching the ball?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/b/d5ba3f8a7071f8b636fab5634f9665faae282105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 15 m, Chris \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 15 m, Pat \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 14 m, Chris \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 14 m, Pat \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 16 m, Pat$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"683\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>At each distance, two throws are made: the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/7/9f7ea9509746655dacd2e1e9b04c09510b683ae1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1st$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"23\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/7/2f70446903092eba3f2b00b779566e611caa393e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2nd$\" width=\"29\" height=\"12\" /> throws are made at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/f/73fc5595f2c0be4a04869697724a604fae646c46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 m$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"24\" height=\"12\" />, the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/1/381de27582b66bef9b438965719a75fec0492dc2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3rd$\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/8/7e8f916b1d022f4c6ccbb2f8391870977eb0039a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4th$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"25\" height=\"13\" /> are made at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/9/09930426d38eccb974422733e80ed818dcb14f2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 m$\" width=\"24\" height=\"12\" />, and so on, with the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/9/18995e4abddf85e4d8a492931cdddb38cac1b0e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$27th$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"37\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/5/c958f7389fe57d4ebee4d3249c0353ab9a556d37.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$28th$\" width=\"34\" height=\"12\" /> throws being made at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/7/17746b656e21267e8465c165f82c118cd4e818f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14 m$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"33\" height=\"12\" />.\nTherefore, the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/986c85c3c8fde5350e3ca94a6a768c70368bc42a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$29th$\" width=\"34\" height=\"12\" /> throw is the first throw made at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/c/e9c4c3418c87b2f8c78183dbdb0d71ac95cf0497.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 m.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"37\" height=\"13\" />\nAt each distance, the first throw is made by Pat to Chris, so Chris misses catching the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/986c85c3c8fde5350e3ca94a6a768c70368bc42a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$29th$\" width=\"34\" height=\"12\" /> throw at a distance of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/0/33084f547c1d2d4e426e7ce16075ee561efee030.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 m$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" />.  The answer is therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"2005 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">2005 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems\" title=\"2005 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key\" title=\"2005 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2005 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2005 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2005 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2005 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2005 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2005 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2005 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2005 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2005 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2005 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7